------------------------------------------------------------------------
Overview of Modules & Executables:

TRANSITFIT5 - Photometric transit modeling, RVs, TTVs, and Differential Evolution MCMC posteriors.
   transitfit51: Modern Fortran 90 Levenberg-Marquardt optimizer for multi-planet transit models.
   transitfit5:  Levenberg-Marquardt transit model fitter.
   transitmcmc5: Differential Evolution MCMC sampler for posterior probability distributions.
   transitcut5:  Cuts out photometry data beyond +/- transit durations.
   sigclip:      Sigma-clipping outlier rejection routine.
   transitsn5:   Estimates signal-to-noise ratio of transits based on transit model.
   transittiming5: Fits center-of-transit times for TTV analysis.
   transitdepth5: Estimates transit depth from transit parameters.
   transitplot5: Plots folded lightcurves and transit models (PGPLOT).

DATATEST - MAST FITS file reading and lightcurve detrending routines.
   detrend51:    Parallelized out-of-transit running polynomial baseline detrending.
   detrend5:     Detrends lightcurves while preserving transit signals via transit models.
   kfitsread:    Reads Kepler FITS lightcurve files from MAST (CFITSIO).
   sigclip:      Outlier clipping routine.

TRANSITFIND - Transit discovery algorithms.
   transitfind5: Optimized Box-fitting Least Squares (BLS) transit search algorithm.
   transitfind2: Optimized BLS transit search.
   pdmsearch:    Phase Dispersion Minimization (PDM) search.
